---
layout: base.njk
title: ""
description: "Software engineer building well-crafted systems and thoughtful interfaces."
---

{# ── HERO ── #}
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="hero__eyebrow">software engineer</p>
    <h1 class="hero__name">
      Kol<br>
      <em>Mikaelson</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="hero__tagline">
      Building things with care — systems that last,<br>
      interfaces that breathe.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="hero__scroll" aria-hidden="true">
    <span>scroll</span>
    <div class="hero__scroll-line"></div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── ABOUT ── #}
<section id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="two-col fade-up">
      <div class="section-label">about</div>
      <div class="about__content">
        <p class="about__bio">
          I'm a software engineer drawn to the intersection of well-crafted systems
          and thoughtful user experience. I care about the quality of the substrate —
          the abstractions that let teams move fast without accumulating chaos.
        </p>
        <p class="about__bio">
          Currently focused on distributed systems and developer tooling.
          I believe the best code is the code that doesn't need explaining.
        </p>
        <ul class="about__skills">
          <li>TypeScript</li>
          <li>Node.js</li>
          <li>Go</li>
          <li>Rust</li>
          <li>PostgreSQL</li>
          <li>Systems design</li>
          <li>Developer tooling</li>
          <li>API design</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── PROJECTS ── #}
<section id="projects">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="two-col">
      <div class="section-label">work</div>
      <div>
        <ol class="projects__list">

          <li class="project">
            <a href="https://github.com/kol-mikaelson" class="project__link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <div class="project__meta">
                <span class="project__number">01</span>
                <span class="project__year">2025</span>
              </div>
              <h2 class="project__name">
                Axiom
                <span class="project__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
              </h2>
              <p class="project__desc">
                A lightweight runtime assertion library for TypeScript — zero dependencies,
                full type inference, designed for the places where you need certainty.
              </p>
              <ul class="project__tags">
                <li>TypeScript</li>
                <li>Open Source</li>
              </ul>
            </a>
          </li>

          <li class="project">
            <a href="https://github.com/kol-mikaelson" class="project__link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <div class="project__meta">
                <span class="project__number">02</span>
                <span class="project__year">2025</span>
              </div>
              <h2 class="project__name">
                Relay
                <span class="project__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
              </h2>
              <p class="project__desc">
                An event-driven job queue backed by PostgreSQL — durable, observable,
                and boring in the best way. Replaces Redis for teams that already have Postgres.
              </p>
              <ul class="project__tags">
                <li>Go</li>
                <li>PostgreSQL</li>
                <li>Distributed systems</li>
              </ul>
            </a>
          </li>

          <li class="project">
            <a href="https://github.com/kol-mikaelson" class="project__link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <div class="project__meta">
                <span class="project__number">03</span>
                <span class="project__year">2024</span>
              </div>
              <h2 class="project__name">
                Cartographer
                <span class="project__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
              </h2>
              <p class="project__desc">
                A CLI tool that generates dependency graphs from TypeScript codebases —
                visualise what actually imports what before you refactor.
              </p>
              <ul class="project__tags">
                <li>Rust</li>
                <li>WASM</li>
                <li>CLI</li>
              </ul>
            </a>
          </li>

          <li class="project">
            <a href="https://github.com/kol-mikaelson" class="project__link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <div class="project__meta">
                <span class="project__number">04</span>
                <span class="project__year">2024</span>
              </div>
              <h2 class="project__name">
                Folio
                <span class="project__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
              </h2>
              <p class="project__desc">
                This site. A minimal portfolio and blog built with 11ty —
                no JS framework, no build complexity, just craft.
              </p>
              <ul class="project__tags">
                <li>11ty</li>
                <li>CSS</li>
                <li>Vanilla JS</li>
              </ul>
            </a>
          </li>

        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── WRITING TEASER ── #}
{% if collections.posts.length %}
<section id="writing">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="two-col fade-up">
      <div class="section-label">writing</div>
      <div>
        <div class="writing__list">
          {% for post in collections.posts %}{% if loop.index <= 3 %}
          <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="writing-item">
            <div class="writing-item__title">{{ post.data.title }}</div>
            <div class="writing-item__meta">
              <span>{{ post.date | dateDisplay }}</span>
              <span>{{ post.templateContent | readingTime }}</span>
            </div>
          </a>
          {% endif %}{% endfor %}
        </div>
        <a href="/blog/" class="writing__more">all posts →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}
